<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Vishay said upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Vishay said upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns electronics components analyst Tom Hopkins upgraded Visha Intertechnology Inc to buy from attractive, according to a source at the firm.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 7/8 to 29-3/4.</p>
</text>
